Paul Gardner-Stephen writes:
 > Hi,
 > 
 > I am having problems running OSF 4.0 binaries under FreeBSD 5.0-RELEASE on an 
 > alpha personal workstation 500au:

Its a bug in 5.0 that only bites SMP kernels (GENERIC is SMP on
alpha).  This was just fixed Sat. in -currrent.  See the freebsd-alpha
archives for the patch.  Or rebuild a kernel without 'options SMP', or
upgrade to -current.

Cheers,

Drew
